  "invariants": [
    "Oracle labels never enter reader-visible input or runtime index.",
    "A raw-native result must never be substituted with canonical-pool QA performance.",
    "Revoked/superseded revisions remain historically auditable but cannot be silently selected for a query whose known_at includes the governing event.",
    "Scope, provenance, relevance and support are separate gates.",
    "Abstention/restraint and activation are scored as positive governed behavior, not as missing recall."
  ]
}
